  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b5a08e4ab530b9c4fa63ef5a5c611cbe, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tutorial_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - '(Mechanic discovered: use space to advance the dialog)'
  - Welcome to the Angels' playground.
  - The angels were kind enough to provide a dream world where you can play around
    before jumping in.
  - Feel free to move and look around and, when you're ready, follow the path towards
    the banner.
  - '(Mechanic discovered: use WASD to move your character and your mouse to look
    around)'
  - When you get to the banner you'll want to interact with it.
  - '(Mechanic discovered: press E near an interactable to interact with it)'
  - '(Mechanic discovered: press I anywhere to check your inventory)'
  unlockedMechanics:
  - Movement
  - Interact
  - Inventory
